              <rules>
                <rule name="Finest Hour" id="8a4ad346-8015-f590-2c9c-390d3cf691ed" hidden="false">
                  <description>Once per game, at the start of any of their turns, a player may choose to take his Warlord&apos;s Finest Hour.
The warlord has a 3++ and Eternal Warrior and is allowed to order an All-out Attack.
Furthermore you may roll on the Exemplar Tables or use the Sons of the Primarch-rule.
These effects last until the Warlord&apos;s next turn.</description>
                </rule>
