              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer knows an additional Psychic power from the Daemonology (Sanctic) discipline. In addition, the bearer and friendly units from the Grey Knights-Faction within 6&quot; re-roll 1&apos;s when taking psychic tests when attempting to manifest powers from the Daemonology discipline.</characteristic>
